@Web_API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7198
@accessToken = paste-an-auth0-access-token-requested-with-pkce

### Public endpoint: no token required
GET {{Web_API_HostAddress}}/api/test/public
Accept: application/json

### Protected endpoint: requires an Auth0 access token for https://trip-planner-api
GET {{Web_API_HostAddress}}/api/test/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List trips owned by me or shared with me
GET {{Web_API_HostAddress}}/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Read the chronological route for a trip
GET {{Web_API_HostAddress}}/api/trips/1/itinerary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

